<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Kansas City cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Kansas City cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it downgraded Kansas City Southern Industries Inc to near-term accumulate from buy.</p>
<p>-- the long-term rating was kept at buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1-1/8 to 45-7/8.</p>
</text>
